HasseDiagram -- the class of Hasse diagrams
*******************************************

Description
===========

A Hasse diagram is a list describing the connexions in a Hasse diagram. It
contains sublists representing rows. Each row contains several vertices
together with edges to some element in the next row given by its position in
the row. This data format is intended for displaying.

