DynkinType ++ DynkinType -- the disjoint union of Dynkin Types
**************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ++: (Macaulay2Doc)++,
  * Usage: 
        T1 ++ T2
  * Inputs:
      * T1, an instance of the type *note DynkinType: DynkinType,, 
      * T2, an instance of the type *note DynkinType: DynkinType,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note DynkinType: DynkinType,, the disjoint
        union (concatenation) of T1 and T2

Description
===========

+----------------------------------+
|i1 : T1=dynkinType(rootSystemB(2))|
|                                  |
|o1 = DynkinType{{B, 2}}           |
|                                  |
|o1 : DynkinType                   |
+----------------------------------+
|i2 : T2=dynkinType(rootSystemA(3))|
|                                  |
|o2 = DynkinType{{A, 3}}           |
|                                  |
|o2 : DynkinType                   |
+----------------------------------+
|i3 : T1++T2                       |
|                                  |
|o3 = DynkinType{{B, 2}, {A, 3}}   |
|                                  |
|o3 : DynkinType                   |
+----------------------------------+

Note that it is not reordered.

