DynkinType == DynkinType -- the equality of Dynkin Types
********************************************************

  * Operator: *note ==: (Macaulay2Doc)==,
  * Usage: 
        T1 == T2
  * Inputs:
      * T1, an instance of the type *note DynkinType: DynkinType,, 
      * T2, an instance of the type *note DynkinType: DynkinType,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, true if T1 is isomorphic
        to T2 and false if not

Description
===========

+----------------------------------+
|i1 : T1=dynkinType(rootSystemB(2))|
|                                  |
|o1 = DynkinType{{B, 2}}           |
|                                  |
|o1 : DynkinType                   |
+----------------------------------+
|i2 : T2=dynkinType(rootSystemA(3))|
|                                  |
|o2 = DynkinType{{A, 3}}           |
|                                  |
|o2 : DynkinType                   |
+----------------------------------+
|i3 : (T1++T2) == (T2++T1)         |
|                                  |
|o3 = true                         |
+----------------------------------+

whereas

+--------------------------+
|i4 : (T1++T2) === (T2++T1)|
|                          |
|o4 = false                |
+--------------------------+

